  "description": "The LED daytime running lights are not only used as a sleek DRL but also function as sequential switchback turn signals to keep others informed of your intentions when you change lane or make a turn.\nFitment\n2004-2008 Ford F150 Pickup\nNOT Compatible with 2004 F150 Heritage\nNOT Compatible with Flareside Beds Models\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\nPlug-N-Play Operation\nEasy bolt-on replacement for your headlights, connect daytime running light to your car wiring. The attached user instruction makes the assembly more straightforward.\nBi-functional LED Daytime Running Lights\nNot only used as a sleek LED daytime running lamp but functions as a sequential switchback turn signal to keep others informed of your intentions when you change lane or make a turn.\nOne-way Vents & Fully Sealed to Prevent Moisture\nFully sealed with solid silicon & designed with one-way vents to prevent moisture from being trapped inside the housing.\nImpact resistance, sharper lighting\nThe polycarbonate lens & tough housing are highly resistant to shock, vibration for any tough road; the durable lens is also impervious to fogging, discoloring, and scratch for an enhanced driving experience.",
